message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the underlying thesis."
title: "rbcm: Regression-Based methods for Correlated Mediators"
abstract: "An R Shiny application implementing two parametric methods (CC and CNC) for causal mediation analysis when mediators are correlated but not causally linked, due to an unmeasured common cause."
